<title>USA: Keystone in new $25 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Keystone in new $25 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keystone Automotive Industries Inc said Tuesday that it has established a new $25 million unsecured credit facility with Mellon Bank.</p>
<p>The company said the new credit facility will result in significantly lower borrowing costs and provide it with additional financial flexibility.</p>
<p>Keystone distributes its products in the United States primarily to collision repair shops.  It operates 67 service centers, in 31 states.</p>
</text>
